                    <div>
                        <strong style="font-size:0.95rem; color:#0f172a;">🔀 Visual Rule Builder + Expression Engine</strong>
                        <div style="font-size:0.76rem; color:#64748b;">Combine visual rule rows with rich expressions like <code>daysBetween(today(), $ctx.fields.start_date) &lt;= 30</code>.</div>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <label style="font-size:0.74rem; font-weight:800; color:#334155;">Compiled Expression Formula ($ctx)</label>
